<title>UK: Railtrack shares firm ahead of results.</title>
<headline>Railtrack shares firm ahead of results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Railtrack Plc firmed on Monday on buying interest ahead of first-half figures on November 15, traders  said.</p>
<p>Analysts' interim forecasts range from 149 to 155 million stg, up from 98 million stg in the same period last year.</p>
<p>&quot;We've seen a couple of buyers around this morning ahead of Friday's numbers,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>Shares in Railtrack were trading 11p higher at 287p mid-morning on volume of 1.6 million. Railtrack hit a closing high of 302-1/2p on September 27.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8712</p>
</text>
